{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "みなさんこんにちは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46の小島凪紗です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Lonesome rabbit」テレビ初披露"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いかがでしたか〜？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回はMVに合わせて少し強めのメイクで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "バチバチに踊りました^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少しでも楽曲の魅力が伝わったら嬉しいです〜！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobcAFTBR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美青がカメラ構えたら入ってきてくださいました！笑笑"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "映り込みまつりさん☺︎"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob3iKwox.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobJjvGpf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobkBpmTe.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobbPj33Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobzNDCI7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日は「CDTVライブ！ライブ！」で「What’s “KAZOKU”?」を初披露させていただきました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46として、2週連続で出演させていただけてとても嬉しかったです🙌🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moboeQ1Cx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNui9x3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVも公開されています♪"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "MVのオフショ